Hi, below are the ones I am using. I took these macros from a place I no
longer remember. There were others also but these were the ones i liked
most. They work as follows: 

Type		h1 title nh1 par try this npar 
to get          <h1> title </h1> <p> try this </p>

You can also press

   ^x^w		to make the word under the cursor a hyperlink.
   ^x^l		to make the current line a hyperlink
   ^x^1		to mahe the current line Heading 1 style
   ^x^2		to make the current line Heading 2 style
         ...
   ^x^3         to make the current line Heading 6 style

I should also mention that I use the VIM vi clone and strongly recommend
it(www.vim.org).

