Hi!

First, Thanks to all who responsed to my question below.

All have saying that the file system format of the OpenVMS CD
is Files-11 format and Digital UNIX has no support for that
file system.  I also called Digital Corp for the answer. 
They also saying the same thing.

The only way to copy those files to Digital UNIX system is
to put the CD on a VMS system and use UCX to serve it to 
the UNIX.

Thanks,
/PC.


______________________________ Forward Header __________________________________
Subject: How to mount OpenVMS CDs on UNIX
