not
have a DNS entry. Check the location and try again.
I even get this message from the console when i try. i swear i havn't =
touched
a thing. in fact up until last night the system has been up and running
beautifully for 122 days since my last reboot. ive been running this =
baby for
over a year and haven't had any real problems.
