There are a number of utilities that apparently solve this need.

1. A SVR4 package that comes on the associated products CD, contains sar, fuser, truss, timex, fmli, svr4-printspooler etc. 
The packages are:
SVEADM410           installed  System Management Package (System V
Environment)
