Many thanks to following friends give me below 3 solutions:
  Steve Gibbons <steve@wyrm.AZTech.Net>
  bchill@bch.net (Brian C Hill)
  MC.Vialatte@cust.univ-bpclermont.fr
  Rainer Freis <freis@santix.de>
  Declan Lennon <Declan.Lennon@digital.com>
  Stan Horwitz <stan@thunder.ocis.temple.edu>
  Tom Blinn <tpb@zk3.dec.com>
  alan@nabeth.cxo.dec.com
  Casey Spangler <spang@probita.com>
  George Guethlein <GGuethlein@GiantOfMaryland.com>


