    *Priv* (bchill@bch.net) 
       ftp://pub/unix/priv.tar.gz
    *sudo* (MC.Vialatte@cust.univ-pclermont.fr,
            freis@santix.de,
            stan@thunder.ocis.temple.edu
            Casey Spangler <spang@probita.com>
